edits of two other network shows  henry danger and game shakers his  experience as a faux producer  must have helped him get familiar with  work behind the camera  he directed 11 episodes for henry danger  nickelodeon's comedy series about a  teenager who gets a part-time job  helping a superhero  he also took the director's reigns for  six episodes of game shakers which  follows the fictional story of two  wildly successful teens this time in the  world of game making  kress has also been charismatic enough  to return as himself in both series as  well as a number of nickelodeon specials  including throwback with nickelodeon  which focuses on the nostalgia of old  nick shows and the after party a  post-prime time talk show  cress had a role in the 2014 fictional  disaster film into the storm  he began dating his cast mate from the  movie london elise moore and they  married and in 2017 they had their first  child while in december 2020 cress  announced via his instagram that the  family was now expecting their second  child his podcast radioactive dads  focuses on working and raising children  in hollywood  the show features chris his co-host  brett davern of mtv's awkward and other  celebrity parents  the hosts chat about working on set and  discuss their evolving perspective as  millennials moving into the parenting  phase of their lives  cress is a big advocate for parenting he  even joined a movement  entitled man enough led by author justin  baldoni according to the program the  movement is  founded on the belief that by undefining  traditional roles and traits of  masculinity  men will be able to realize their  potential as humans and their capacity  for connection  however busy he is as a parent he still  hasn't stopped working  in 2020 et online reported the viacom  cbs announcement that a reboot of icarly  would premiere on the network's  streaming service paramount plus  the new show will appropriately be  called icarly revival  the reboot sees the return of miranda  cosgrove as well as jerry traynor  who played carly's brother spencer  however jeanette mccurdy has announced  that she will not be returning  in january 2021 cress posted a photo  from the set of the show that features  the three returning actors smiling into  the camera  the show premiered june 17th and is  loaded with all those nostalgic feels  that you've been missing  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  your favorite unheralded actors are  coming soon  subscribe to our youtube channel and hit  the bell so you don't miss a single one  you
 

